SUMMARY:MKL — Call #3
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: MARKEL GROUP INC (MKL)\nRoadshow: URL: https://dealroadshow.finsig
 ht.com | Entry Code: MKL2026 | Direct Link: https://dealroadshow.finsight.
 com/e/MKL2026\n\nDeal context:\nMarkel Group Inc. (MKL) is launching an in
 augural offering of 30-year fixed-rate Pre-Capitalized Trust Securities (P
 -CAPs) through a newly formed trust\, Maymont Funding Trust\, denominated 
 in U.S. dollars under Rule 144A / Section 3(c)(7) of the Investment Compan
 y Act\, with no size or pricing terms disclosed at this stage. The deal is
  at the Mandate stage\, with a series of global fixed income investor call
 s scheduled for Monday\, August 17th\, 2026\, hosted by Wells Fargo Securi
 ties as Sole Structuring Advisor and Lead Left Bookrunner\, alongside BofA
  Securities and J.P. Morgan as Joint Bookrunners. The P-CAPs are expected 
 to be rated Baa2 (stable) / BBB+ (stable) by Moody's and S&P respectively\
 , in-line with MKL's existing senior unsecured notes.
